  "practical_limits": [
    "Clothing uses skinned geometry and local corrective morphs; it is not an independent cloth simulation.",
    "Traversal requests are integrated with real collision and support. The demo arranges its stations; general obstacle recognition and navigation are the integrating game responsibility.",
    "Geometry checks use documented seam tolerances and exclusions, and visual review is resolution-limited. Passing them does not prove every possible runtime contact or world configuration.",
    "Every authored integer animation frame was reviewed in four directions; dynamic ragdoll visual review is sampled and separately identified.",
    "Raw frame PNG sets are represented by the packaged all-frame video, exact capture/review manifests and reproducible capture tool. Live outcome PNGs are included.",
    "The GLB carries the rig, materials and animations. Living behavior, demonstration and native ragdoll integration are in the Godot project."
  ]
